@startuml
title T12-WF02 — AI Lead Enrichment Agent
start
:01 | RabbitMQ Trigger\nconsume enrichment requests.;
:02 | Code: Normalize Event\nparse payload and validate lead/request IDs.;
:03 | HTTP Request: Get Lead\nobtain authoritative lead fields.;
:04 | Code: Extract Domain\nnormalize email and website, identify free-email domains.;
:05 | HTTP Request: Mock Enrichment Adapter\nuse deterministic fixture/mock data with providerMode=MOCK whenever a real enrichment provider is not configured; never present mock data as verified external facts;
:06 | Code: Normalize Provider Result\nmap provider fields into the agreed schema.;
:07 | Code: Validate Completeness\ndistinguish SUCCESS, PARTIAL and FAILED, never manufacture unknown data.;
:08 | HTTP Request: Enrichment Callback\nreturn structured findings to NestJS.;
if (09 | Partial or failed?) then (yes)
  :10 | HTTP Request: Backend Notification\nnotify the owner through NestJS if configured.;
else (no)
endif
:11 | Code: Build Run Summary\ninclude provider mode (real/mock), status and correlation IDs.;
:12 | Code: Finalize Execution Output\nreturn a final structured output for n8n execution/logging.;
stop
@enduml
